{"id":"2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal","date":"2026-10-20","topic":"markets","region":"europe","headline":"Engineer Builds Small Tidal Energy Generator for Coastal Towns","source":{"name":"BBC","url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c8y56y6xg9n9o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss"},"accent":"uk","tiers":{"t1":{"sentences":[{"text":"David Mummery built a small sea power machine.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t1-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.32,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t1-0.m4a","durJa":4.19,"times":[0.0,0.3,1.0,1.28,1.54,1.82,2.22,2.58]},{"text":"He started a company named Flex Marine Power.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t1-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":3.01,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t1-1.m4a","durJa":4.15,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.54,0.88,1.42,1.82,2.26]},{"text":"The small device makes energy from rushing water.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t1-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":2.94,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t1-2.m4a","durJa":4.82,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.26,0.52,1.04,1.42,1.78,2.12]},{"text":"It gives power to thirty homes near the sea.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t1-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":2.61,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t1-3.m4a","durJa":4.13,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.24,0.48,0.84,1.2,1.6,2.02,2.14]},{"text":"Local workers put the small parts together very easily.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t1-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M"],"dur":3.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t1-4.m4a","durJa":5.23,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.58,0.92,1.06,1.28,1.58,2.0,2.4]}],"bands":{"core1000":90,"core1800":5,"ngsl":0,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":5},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"built","title":"Simple Past Tense","note":"The simple past tense is used for completed actions in the past. Here, 'built' shows that David already finished making the machine."},{"i":3,"focus":"gives power to thirty homes","title":"Direct Object with Prepositional Phrase","note":"This sentence follows a basic verb-object structure followed by a prepositional phrase. 'Power' is the object being given, and 'to thirty homes' shows who receives it."}]},"t2":{"sentences":[{"text":"David Mummery designed a small sea power machine in Scotland.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O","M","M"],"dur":4.23,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-0.m4a","durJa":5.5,"times":[0.0,0.3,0.98,1.32,1.66,1.94,2.38,2.76,3.16,3.4]},{"text":"He started his company because big power projects cost too much.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-1.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.11,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-1.m4a","durJa":6.13,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.34,0.64,1.04,1.48,1.84,2.2,2.74,3.16,3.5]},{"text":"The machine stays under the water so people cannot see it.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-2.m4a","durJa":4.81,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.32,0.74,1.12,1.34,1.64,2.16,2.52,2.8,3.16]},{"text":"It will make enough power for thirty homes near the ocean.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-3.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.38,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-3.m4a","durJa":5.53,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.2,0.38,0.7,1.16,1.42,1.8,2.2,2.64,2.78]},{"text":"Local workers will put the small machine together from a box.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-4.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":3.42,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-4.m4a","durJa":5.14,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.58,0.9,1.1,1.26,1.48,1.8,2.3,2.7,2.8]},{"text":"Small towns will build their own clean power and save money.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t2-5.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","V","O"],"dur":4.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t2-5.m4a","durJa":5.68,"times":[0.0,0.22,0.58,0.88,1.08,1.38,1.64,2.02,2.52,3.0,3.26]}],"bands":{"core1000":95,"core1800":0,"ngsl":2,"tsl":0,"nawl":0,"beyond":3},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"because big power projects cost too much","title":"Adverbial Clause of Reason","note":"The conjunction 'because' introduces a clause explaining the reason for the main action. It tells us why he started his company."},{"i":3,"focus":"will make","title":"Future Tense with Will","note":"The auxiliary verb 'will' combines with the base verb 'make' to express a future prediction or capability. It indicates an expected outcome."}]},"t3":{"sentences":[{"text":"British engineer David Mummery has created a small device that makes energy from tides.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.22,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-0.m4a","durJa":8.29,"times":[0.0,0.32,0.94,1.44,2.16,2.52,2.94,3.26,3.54,3.92,4.36,4.56,4.98,5.44]},{"text":"His company, Flex Marine Power, has built a tidal generator called the Swimmer Turbine.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":5.91,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-1.m4a","durJa":7.35,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.86,1.06,1.46,2.32,2.52,2.76,2.98,3.3,3.82,4.48,4.78,5.18]},{"text":"This compact ocean unit sits on the seabed, which keeps it hidden under water.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.14,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-2.m4a","durJa":6.3,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.64,1.04,1.6,1.96,2.3,2.42,3.3,3.42,3.66,3.88,4.18,4.52]},{"text":"The fifty-kilowatt machine generates electricity, which can supply power to about thirty homes.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.99,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-3.m4a","durJa":7.17,"times":[0.0,0.2,0.94,1.28,1.86,3.24,3.26,3.44,3.68,4.16,4.46,4.64,5.12]},{"text":"Mummery previously worked on large marine energy projects, including a floating wave device.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-4.m4a","roles":["S","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":5.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-4.m4a","durJa":6.4,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.86,1.34,1.62,1.88,2.26,2.76,3.68,4.02,4.4,4.64,5.06]},{"text":"He has designed this light system so local workers can assemble it from containers.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-5.m4a","roles":["S","V","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":4.83,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-5.m4a","durJa":6.92,"times":[0.0,0.1,0.22,0.52,0.84,1.14,1.58,2.04,2.36,2.8,3.18,3.44,3.74,3.94]},{"text":"Small villages can easily receive the parts and launch the power system themselves.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t3-6.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","V","O","O","M","V","O","O","O","M"],"dur":5.13,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t3-6.m4a","durJa":6.87,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.5,0.94,1.22,1.8,2.02,2.22,2.82,3.06,3.3,3.46,3.86]}],"bands":{"core1000":74,"core1800":9,"ngsl":3,"tsl":4,"nawl":0,"beyond":10},"grammar":[{"i":0,"focus":"has created","title":"Present Perfect Tense","note":"The present perfect connects past action to present relevance. It emphasizes that the device exists now as a result of his past effort."},{"i":2,"focus":", which keeps it hidden under water","title":"Non-defining Relative Clause","note":"This clause starts with 'which' after a comma to provide extra comment on the whole main sentence. It explains the practical benefit of sitting on the seabed."}]},"t4":{"sentences":[{"text":"Engineer David Mummery has developed a 50-kilowatt tidal generator to assist small coastal communities.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-0.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","O","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-0.m4a","durJa":9.02,"times":[0.0,0.4,1.0,1.68,1.92,2.22,2.41,3.52,3.86,4.46,5.0,5.22,5.8,6.2]},{"text":"His Glasgow-based company, Flex Marine Power, was established in 2011 to build compact ocean technology.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-1.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.33,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-1.m4a","durJa":9.75,"times":[0.0,0.18,0.82,1.72,1.86,2.2,3.1,3.28,3.66,4.04,4.72,5.16,5.36,5.76,6.22]},{"text":"The Swimmer Turbine is anchored to the seabed, where its metal and fiberglass frame remains unseen.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-2.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.36,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-2.m4a","durJa":6.27,"times":[0.0,0.08,0.46,1.0,1.32,1.62,1.96,2.06,2.88,3.06,3.24,3.6,3.84,4.42,4.82,5.28]},{"text":"Electricity generated by this single turbine is expected to supply approximately 30 residential homes.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","S","S","S","S","V","V","C","C","C","C","C","C"],"dur":6.59,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-3.m4a","durJa":7.07,"times":[0.0,0.44,1.1,1.44,1.62,1.9,2.4,2.88,3.2,3.52,3.84,4.56,5.1,5.72]},{"text":"Mummery stated that massive energy projects were often created without involving the local residents living nearby.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":6.63,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-4.m4a","durJa":7.28,"times":[0.0,0.4,0.7,1.02,1.38,1.84,2.38,2.72,2.98,3.36,3.82,4.6,4.78,4.96,5.34,5.78]},{"text":"Before launching his business, he gained valuable industry experience on major projects like the Pelamis wave device.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":6.88,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-5.m4a","durJa":7.38,"times":[0.0,0.26,0.66,0.9,1.8,1.82,2.0,2.44,2.9,3.52,3.94,4.22,4.72,5.22,5.46,5.9,6.1]},{"text":"Unlike huge industrial arrays, this low-cost system is delivered in shipping containers with about 20 parts.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","S","S","S","V","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":7.16,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-6.m4a","durJa":7.78,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.64,1.18,2.34,2.58,3.0,3.36,3.76,4.0,4.32,4.54,5.02,5.72,5.9,6.32]},{"text":"Local crews can follow basic instructions to assemble the unit and deploy it from nearby harbors.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t4-7.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","V","O","M","M","M"],"dur":5.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t4-7.m4a","durJa":7.06,"times":[0.0,0.16,0.58,0.88,1.16,1.54,1.94,2.48,2.82,3.04,3.3,3.8,4.14,4.34,4.54,4.74]}],"bands":{"core1000":65,"core1800":11,"ngsl":10,"tsl":4,"nawl":1,"beyond":9},"grammar":[{"i":1,"focus":"was established","title":"Passive Voice","note":"The passive voice highlights the action done to the subject rather than who performed it. Here, it shifts focus onto the company itself."},{"i":3,"focus":"Electricity generated by this single turbine","title":"Past Participle Phrase","note":"The phrase 'generated by...' acts like a reduced relative clause modifying 'Electricity'. It concisely shows origin without using full clause words like 'which is'."}]},"t5":{"sentences":[{"text":"After working on large-scale offshore projects like Orkney's Pelamis wave device, mechanical engineer David Mummery shifted his focus toward localized renewable energy.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-0.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M"],"dur":11.55,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-0.m4a","durJa":13.98,"times":[0.0,0.36,0.66,0.86,1.68,2.04,2.84,3.26,3.96,4.52,4.74,5.78,6.08,6.78,7.22,7.86,8.24,8.56,8.84,9.38,9.94,10.56]},{"text":"In 2011, Mummery founded Flex Marine Power to develop the Swimmer Turbine, an ultra-compact 50-kilowatt generator anchored directly to the seabed.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-1.m4a","roles":["M","M","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.63,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-1.m4a","durJa":12.18,"times":[0.0,0.06,1.04,1.56,2.0,2.32,2.7,3.24,3.76,4.0,4.38,4.78,5.88,6.09,7.05,7.88,8.22,8.98,9.52,9.94,10.04]},{"text":"Submerged completely out of sight, the fiberglass and steel device harnesses fast-flowing tidal currents to deliver electricity to roughly 30 coastal households.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-2.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","S","S","S","S","S","V","O","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":10.17,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-2.m4a","durJa":10.61,"times":[0.0,0.52,0.9,1.38,1.52,2.28,2.38,2.88,3.18,3.46,3.86,4.61,5.58,5.82,6.34,6.84,7.06,7.6,8.04,8.22,8.72,9.14]},{"text":"The prototype was initially tested during the early 2010s in a discreet Scottish Highlands river before undergoing further trials at Strangford Narrows.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-3.m4a","roles":["S","S","V","M","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.97,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-3.m4a","durJa":10.39,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.34,0.8,1.14,1.58,2.0,2.18,2.46,3.32,3.72,3.8,4.12,4.5,5.06,5.76,6.16,6.54,6.98,7.4,7.74,8.26]},{"text":"Mummery designed the unit as a low-cost, self-assembly system that offers an accessible alternative to multimillion-dollar industrial tidal arrays across Scotland.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-4.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":9.49,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-4.m4a","durJa":11.57,"times":[0.0,0.38,0.6,0.9,1.14,1.4,1.51,2.08,2.88,3.5,4.0,4.22,4.42,4.78,5.44,5.65,7.02,7.38,8.02,8.4,8.78]},{"text":"Shipped inside a single freight container, the turbine consists of approximately 20 modular components that can be assembled using basic tools.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-5.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M"],"dur":8.2,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-5.m4a","durJa":9.45,"times":[0.0,0.24,0.48,0.86,1.16,1.42,2.46,2.52,2.78,3.26,3.6,3.92,4.48,4.96,5.48,6.14,6.26,6.38,6.66,7.16,7.46]},{"text":"By enabling local fishermen and harbor workers to build and deploy the equipment themselves, the venture aims to empower isolated coastal towns.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-6.m4a","roles":["M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","M","S","S","V","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":7.98,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-6.m4a","durJa":9.7,"times":[0.0,0.06,0.42,0.72,1.1,1.5,1.72,2.08,2.4,2.66,2.92,3.22,3.48,3.76,4.98,5.06,5.24,5.52,5.78,6.1,6.66,7.16]},{"text":"Mummery believes this grassroots approach ensures that small communities directly benefit from the immense energy potential surrounding the British coastline.","voice":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/t5-7.m4a","roles":["S","V","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O","O"],"dur":8.65,"voiceJa":"voice/2026-10-20-markets-engineer-builds-small-tidal/ja/t5-7.m4a","durJa":11.72,"times":[0.0,0.34,0.6,0.84,1.2,2.06,2.52,2.88,3.1,3.62,4.18,4.66,5.04,5.18,5.52,5.96,6.4,6.98,7.34,7.58]}],"bands":{"core1000":55,"core1800":15,"ngsl":7,"tsl":5,"nawl":1,"beyond":17},"grammar":[{"i":2,"focus":"Submerged completely out of sight","title":"Participial Phrase Modifying Subject","note":"This introductory participial phrase describes the state of the main subject before it appears. It adds descriptive detail smoothly at the start of the sentence."},{"i":6,"focus":"By enabling local fishermen and harbor workers to build and deploy","title":"Preposition with Gerund Clause","note":"The preposition 'By' combined with the gerund 'enabling' introduces the means or method. It explains how the project will achieve its primary aim."}]}},"glossary":[{"word":"turbine","lemma":"turbine","pos":"noun","ipa":"/ˈtɜrbɪn/","definition":"A machine driven by movin